---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
import { profile } from '@/settings'
---

<Layout
	title='Research | Yufei Zhang'
	description='Research interests of Yufei Zhang in quantum-inspired algorithms, combinatorial optimization, diffusion stochastic processes, and learning-based operations research.'
>
	<header class='max-w-3xl border-b border-base-300 pb-10'>
		<p class='section-kicker mb-4'>Research</p>
		<h1 class='font-serif text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl'>Algorithms grounded in careful evidence</h1>
		<p class='mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-base-content/75'>
			My interests connect computational physics, optimization, and high-performance systems. I focus on formulations that can be audited end to end: from mathematical objective and implementation to baseline, measurement, and interpretation.
		</p>
	</header>

	<section class='py-12' aria-labelledby='areas-heading'>
		<h2 id='areas-heading' class='font-serif text-3xl font-bold'>Research areas</h2>
		<div class='mt-8 divide-y divide-base-300 border-y border-base-300'>
			{profile.research_areas.map((area, index) => (
				<article class='grid gap-4 py-8 md:grid-cols-[4rem_14rem_minmax(0,1fr)]'>
					<p class='font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary'>0{index + 1}</p>
					<h3 class='font-serif text-xl font-bold'>{area.title}</h3>
					<p class='leading-7 text-base-content/75'>{area.description}</p>
				</article>
			))}
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class='grid gap-8 border-t border-base-300 py-12 md:grid-cols-2'>
		<div>
			<p class='section-kicker mb-3'>Method</p>
			<h2 class='font-serif text-2xl font-bold'>Correctness before comparison</h2>
			<p class='mt-4 leading-7 text-base-content/75'>
				Changed and reference implementations should see identical inputs. Numerical tolerance, compilation boundaries, warmup, timing, and hardware context belong beside every reported result.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div>
			<p class='section-kicker mb-3'>Interpretation</p>
			<h2 class='font-serif text-2xl font-bold'>Claims match the evidence</h2>
			<p class='mt-4 leading-7 text-base-content/75'>
				Solver time is not end-to-end system latency, and a strong optimization module is not automatically a state-of-the-art tracking pipeline. I keep those boundaries explicit.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
